  "description": "Utility library for .NET from Abblix: a result type for validation chains, a URI builder with query composition, validation attributes, RFC 6750 authentication challenges, Base32 and Base64URL encoding, secure random values, JSON converters, and the pieces a server needs to reach an address somebody else chose without being talked into an internal one. Usable on its own.",
